{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"649","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"月薪15萬以上主管 今起納責任制","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 13px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 13px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><br style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\" />\n<img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/photo(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"width: 800px; height: 533px; cursor: default;\\\" /><br style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\" />\n<br style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\" />\n<span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">勞動部明將公告月薪<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">15</span>萬以上主管納責任制，其中製造業、批發零售業主管影響最多。 圖／聯合報系資料照片</span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"background-color: transparent; border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">2019-05-23 01:02</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">聯合報 記者葉冠妤、陳雨鑫／台北報導</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><br style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\" />\n<span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">勞動部今將公告，月薪十五萬元以上的高階主管（監督、管理人員）、漁船船員適用勞基法第八十四之一條，也就是「責任制」，兩類估接近九萬人可適用，工時、加班和例假等將不受勞基法一般規範限制，即起生效。此外，勞動部下周一也將預告住院醫師將納責任制，預計九月上路。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">值得注意的是，這也是勞基法責任制設計以來，首次未針對特定職類指定適用，改以薪資作為門檻，也就是不管各行各業，凡薪資達標準全都適用責任制。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">另外，勞動部今年初預告時，高階主管薪資門檻設定為廿萬元以上，但隨後採納美國商會建議，並顧及勞退最高級距是十五萬元，實務上便於核對，因而下修，將有更多勞工適用責任制。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">根據據勞動部統計，月薪十五萬元（不包括年終獎金、分紅、加班費等）以上高薪主管約有三點八萬人，製造業、批發零售業各占三成，最多。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">勞動部勞動條件及就業平等司長謝倩蒨說，「監督、管理人員」指受雇負責經營及管理工作，並對一般勞工的受雇、解雇或勞動條件具有決定權力的主管級人員，這次納入責任制的高薪主管，必須兩要件缺一不可。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">至於漁船船員，謝倩蒨說，考量其工作型態特殊，也指定適用責任制。全國目前約有四點八萬名漁船船員。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">此外，住院醫師九月將納入勞基法，勞動部預計廿七日預告住院醫師責任制範疇。衛福部指出，已針對國內廿家醫院訪查，發現總工時達標達九成六，七月起也將進行下一波訪查，幫助醫界銜接勞基法。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">謝倩蒨強調，責任制工作者雖不受每日正常工時八小時、每日總工時上限十二小時、每月加班上限四十六小時等規範，但勞資雙方也應約定工時，並不得損及勞工健康及福祉；且公告指定後，雙方必須完成書面約定且報各地主管機關核備，才生效。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><br style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: text; font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20.8px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\" />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">資料來源：<span style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://udn.com/news/story/7269/3828882\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(7, 130, 193);\\\"><font color=\\\"#0000ff\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\\\">https://udn.com/news/story/7269/3828882</font></a></span></span></span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-05-27","clk_count":"197"}},"__N_SSG":true}